  message: "DONE, both parts. (1) Merged in PR #1377 (commit 6de195bc00): ADR-0048 gives measurement 0006 as 38/112 = 33.9% per situation (was the pass-3 44/112 = 39.3%); its \"2.8x span is zero by design\" is corrected to the SITUATION rate only, with 0006's row rate stated both ways (pooled 31.5%, unweighted per-repo mean 37.2%) per F1; measurements 0010/0012 match. Check: grep \"44/112|39.3\" docs/adr/0048-* returns nothing. (2) Applied 2026-10-01 by the integrator: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/measurement_0006_08252026/ledger-final.json now carries stage / pass4_refuted / pass4_contested / headline_uncontested_tp (38) / headline_rule; `final` and `provenance` byte-identical to the backup ledger-final.json.pre-tuhop-10012026.bak. Caveat: tables.py rewrites the file with only final+provenance. Owner question filed: WI-gihut (P3). Report: run_09302026/tuhop.md"  # f324
